{
"content_id": "313371",
"reference_id": 109055,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "彼得前書 5:1–5",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "60005001-60005005",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>彼得形容<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232719\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">教會長老</data>和領袖是神子民的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232879\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">牧羊人</data>。他對他們的教導就像耶穌在路加福音22:24–30中對祂的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232641\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">門徒</data>的教導。教會領袖不可驕傲或像統治者一樣行事。耶穌是大牧人，他們必須順服祂。他們必須效法耶穌<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232660\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">事奉的領袖</data>的榜樣。忠心服事的領袖將在耶穌回到地上時分享祂的榮耀。其他信徒必須尊重和跟隨像耶穌一樣帶領的領袖。</p>",
